way with Lambda</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AWS</category> <description>REST API Gateway에 Lambda 두 개를 root·resource 경로로 연결하고 GET 파라미터 매핑과 curl 호출까지 확인한 실습</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/api-gateway-with-lambda/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:56:59 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_updated.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/api-gateway-with-lambda/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/2021/04/17/api-gateway-with-lambda.png" type="image/png" length="34158" /> </item> <item> <title>Access S3, DynamoDB with Lambda</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>AWS</category> <description>S3 객체 생성 이벤트로 Lambda를 트리거해 파일을 처리하고 DynamoDB에 적재, test event로 반복 검증한 실습</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/access-s3-dynamodb-with-lambda/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:56:59 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_updated.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/access-s3-dynamodb-with-lambda/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/2021/04/17/access-s3-dynamodb-with-lambda.png" type="image/png" length="40614" /> </item> <item> <title>Failover for HA</title> <author>Jeongwon Lee</author> <category>Database</category> <description>Orchestrator GUI로 MySQL 마스터 장애 시 자동 페일오버를 Docker 컨테이너로 구성하고 인위적 다운으로 승격·복구까지 실습한 기록</description> <link>https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/failover-for-ha/</link> <pubDate>Sun, 16 Aug 2026 08:56:59 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/feed_rss_updated.xml">dotoryeee's blog</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/2021/04/17/failover-for-ha/</guid> <enclosure url="https://dotoryeee.github.io/blog/assets/images/social/2021/04/17/failover-for-ha.png" 